{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">大年初一，走亲访友，年货、年礼必不可少。随着现代物流业的高速发展，人们坐在家中，也能收到来自天南海北的各地特产年货。春节期间，新华社记者走进京东物流郑州亚洲一号智能产业园和智能分拣中心，探访在全流程自动化的加持下，&ldquo;河南特产&rdquo;如何快速走向全国。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流郑州智能分拣中心内，纵横、立体的传送分拣装置在这里发出持续的轰鸣声，一个个包裹在数百条分拣线上高速穿梭，叉车司机、分拣员等在各自的岗位上忙碌不停。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">而在京东物流郑州亚一物流园区的地狼仓内，智能搬运拣选机器人载着货架快速行驶、往来穿梭，拣选员在工作站不断将货架上的货物取出。一台地狼机器人可以承重500公斤，依靠遍布地上的二维码规划路径，还能自动避障，从&ldquo;人找货&rdquo;到&ldquo;货找人&rdquo;，拣选效率提升3倍以上。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225165528.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&uarr; 在京东物流郑州智能分拣中心，工作人员在进行装车作业。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225178921.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&uarr; 在京东物流郑州智能分拣中心，工作人员在进行中小件包裹区分作业。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225186389.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&uarr; 在京东物流郑州亚一物流园区，智能拣选搬运机器人在作业。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225193248.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&uarr; 在京东物流郑州亚一物流园区，工作人员在拣选货物。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225200112.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">&uarr; 在京东物流郑州亚一物流园区，智能拣选搬运机器人在作业。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">■</span> 本文来源：新华社</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新华社记者李嘉南摄影报道</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225232767.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01848", "contentTitle": "新华社新春走基层丨智能分拣助力物流提效增速", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1708222699000, "id": 4142, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708225241294.jpg", "updateTime": 1710383588000}}